WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
narrator: Prepare eight synthetic audit records and an empty receipt journal.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
narrator: Replay the fixture records in the terminal.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:41.000
narrator: Request JSON output for the same synthetic records.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:54.000
narrator: Run the HMAC verifier and inspect its result.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.000
narrator: An empty journal does not exercise live receipt progression.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.000
narrator: Remove the fixture.
